      "apiDescription": "## Props\n\n```\nexport type GScrollbarProps = {\n  /**\n   * @description height of scrollbar\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  height?: string | number;\n  /**\n   * @description max height of scrollbar\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  maxHeight?: string | number;\n  /**\n   * @description whether to use the native scrollbar\n   * @default false\n   */\n  native?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * @description style of wrap\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  wrapStyle?: StyleValue;\n  /**\n   * @description class of wrap\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  wrapClass?: string | unknown[];\n  /**\n   * @description class of view\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  viewClass?: string | unknown[];\n  /**\n   * @description style of view\n   * @default ''\n   */\n  viewStyle?: string | unknown[] | Record<string, any>;\n  /**\n   * @description element tag of the view\n   * @default 'div'\n   */\n  tag?: string;\n  /**\n   * @description minimum size of scrollbar\n   * @default 20\n   */\n  minSize?: number;\n  /**\n   * @description Wrap tabindex\n   * @default undefined\n   */\n  tabindex?: string | number;\n  /** @description do not respond to container size changes, if the container size does not change, it is better to set it to optimize performance */\n  noresize?: boolean;\n  /** @description always show */\n  always?: boolean;\n  ariaOrientation?: string;\n  ariaLabel?: string;\n  /** @description id of view */\n  id?: string;\n  /** @description role of view */\n  role?: string;\n}\n```\n\n## Events\n\n```\nexport type GScrollbarEvents = {\n  scroll: [{ scrollTop: number; scrollLeft: number; }];\n}\n```\n\n## Slots\n\nEach slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.\n\n```\nexport type GScrollbarSlots = {\n  default: {};\n}\n```\n\n## Exposed\n\nAvailable on the component instance through a template ref.\n\n```\nexport type GScrollbarExposed = {\n  /** @description scrollbar wrap ref */\n  wrapRef: any;\n  /** @description update scrollbar state manually */\n  update: () => void;\n  /** @description scrolls to a particular set of coordinates */\n  scrollTo: { (xCord: number, yCord?: number | undefined): void; (options: ScrollToOptions): void; };\n  /** @description set distance to scroll top */\n  setScrollTop: (value: number) => void;\n  /** @description set distance to scroll left */\n  setScrollLeft: (value: number) => void;\n  /** @description handle scroll event */\n  handleScroll: () => void;\n}\n```",
